+def _build_native_image_labels(event, image_paths: List[str]) -> List[str]:
+    """Build one attribution line per natively-attached image.
+
+    Index-aligned with ``image_paths`` (the image subset of
+    ``event.media_urls``, in the same order). Each line names the sender and
+    the send time of the message that image actually came from, resolved from
+    the merge segments when the event is a fused burst and from the event
+    itself otherwise.
+
+    This is the fix for the reported failure: with a pooled hint block, five
+    people's photos in one merged turn rendered as five bare paths at the end
+    of the text, so the model had to guess an owner per image — and in a group
+    chat a wrong guess attributes someone's photo to someone else. The line
+    returned here is placed immediately before its own image block.
