+        rides back out as ``result["interrupt_message"]`` and the drain turns it
+        into the next user turn — but only when the pending slot is empty, so
+        there is no ``MessageEvent`` left for ``_split_user_timestamp`` to read a
+        time from and the message reached the model bare. Stamping at the call
